{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》將於本周日（23日）強勢舉行！終極 7 強陣容塵埃落定，包括尹景順、尤淑情、許美琪、許雲妮、吳亦偉、蔡宓婕以及鄭家聲，眾人將施展渾身解數爭奪終極王者寶座。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">雖然比賽已去到白熱化階段，但台下參賽者之間的感情卻相當深厚，當中許美琪與早前無緣踏上啟德舞台的陳旭培，更結下了猶如親兄妹般的「神仙友誼」！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d700d461-f140-4e58-860f-b390d55eaeef.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026qPkRwShhoB1787121500.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d700d461-f140-4e58-860f-b390d55eaeef.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一直與陳旭培老友鬼鬼的許美琪，日前在社交平台瘋狂大派「洋蔥」，分享了多張與對方的珍貴合照與影片。面對戰友7強止步，美琪坦言心碎一地：「我一睇到結果嗰刻，心都碎埋，喊到唔停，完全唔想接受呢個事實。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">兩人雖然在台上是競爭對手，但私下卻毫無比較之心，由始至終都互相鼓勵。美琪感性寫道：「旭BBBBBBBB！我真係唔知由邊度講起好，我哋啲相同影片實在太多，剪到下世紀都未剪完。記得一開始喺《團戰》等上台嗰時，我喊，你又喊，跟住之後發生咩事，你懂的。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"77bd7533-b68b-4e8b-9aa4-f7b9f29b8697.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026jsVVzNw4FD1787121500.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"77bd7533-b68b-4e8b-9aa4-f7b9f29b8697.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3e17f4f3-6a20-4a8b-95b1-1ac93e060869.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ZVSUFeZHxS1787121500.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3e17f4f3-6a20-4a8b-95b1-1ac93e060869.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1dacb504-203b-4d18-ac30-2ab6c433cb79.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026rSIsKRchEG1787121500.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1dacb504-203b-4d18-ac30-2ab6c433cb79.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了感性的一面，美琪亦大爆兩人私底下極度合拍的搞笑真面目！她笑指大家性格極相似，同樣是「盲盒狂熱分子」，旭培更幫她改了個花名叫「喪買琪」。這對活寶貝更是超強吃貨：「明明話要減肥，但每次點餐都一定點多咗！『今日食聽日減』（雖然通常都係冇減過🤣）。同你一齊可以吹水到唔知時間，我哋又狂笑到條街都聽到！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 在音樂路上，兩人亦是惺惺相惜的好拍檔。美琪直言一直極度欣賞旭培的歌聲：「嗰時喺電視聽到你唱《Careless Whisper》，我話：『哇，佢把聲同 Tone 好正！』同你合唱《Beauty and the Beast》真係正到爆，我好享受同你合唱。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">雖然未能一齊走到終點，但美琪堅定地為這位好兄弟打氣：「你嘅音樂依家先正式開始，一定要俾大家聽多啲你嘅歌聲。Will always be there for you bro，Love you bro！」字裏行間盡顯真摯情誼，相信旭培在決賽當晚，亦一定會在台下為美琪落力打氣！</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T07:00:28.458887+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":796,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}